# /news/ permanent redirects for removed or renamed URLs, one per line: "~^<old path>$" <new path>;
# nginx answers 301 for them (map $fc_news_redirect in scripts/hestia-apply-nginx-cache.sh);
# scripts/news-publish.sh installs this file on every publish. Keys are anchored regexes (escape
# dots) because long exact keys overflow nginx's map hash, as in the PDF canonical map. Point a
# renamed printable at its new file and a removed one at its story; never redirect a live URL.
"~^/news/downloads/premios-billboard-2026/premios-billboard-2026-winners\.pdf$" /news/downloads/premios-billboard-2026/premios-billboard-2026-winners-full-list.pdf;
